              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ANNALIE"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is so delicious - my family complained that I didn't make a larger batch. Of course, Freddy3, it's always wise to be cautious with salt (=sodium), so I used low sodium beef stock and left the seasoned salt out altogether. We needed no extra salt, but everybody is different! I also doubled the beans because we love them!"
